OL,3,AEx-England footballer Raheem Sterling
OL,4,Abeing sentenced for dangerous driving
OL,5,
OL,6,FRaheem Sterling is being sentenced for
OL,7,Fdangerous driving at Basingstoke
OL,8,FMagistrates' Court
OL,10,FThe ex-England footballer, 31, was
OL,11,Farrested after crashing a Lamborghini
OL,12,Fnear the M3 in Hampshire on 28 May -
OL,13,Fpolice body-worn footage captured his
OL,14,Farrest
OL,16,FJason Bartfeld KC, for the defence,
OL,17,Fsays Sterling has "recognised the
OL,18,Fvarious unhealthy coping mechanisms
OL,19,Fthat brought him to this position"
