OL,3,AEx-England footballer Raheem Sterling
OL,4,Abeing sentenced for dangerous driving
OL,5,
OL,6,FSterling pleaded guilty to driving
OL,7,Fdangerously on the M3, the M25, the
OL,8,FA327 and Minley Road - he also admitted
OL,9,Fpossessing nitrous oxide, a Class C
OL,10,Fdrug, for wrongful inhalation, and
OL,11,Ffailing to provide a specimen for
OL,12,Fanalysis
OL,14,FEyewitnesses reported seeing the driver
OL,15,Fof a Lamborghini inhaling from a white
OL,16,Fballoon, with one woman initially
OL,17,Fbelieving an airbag had inflated
OL,19,FSterling has 82 England caps, the last
OL,20,Fof which was won at the 2022 World Cup
OL,21,Fin Qatar
